lding was built. The results are ordered by department name, academic year (descending), and room area range (descending). Do not return any rounded answers.\"}, {\"id\": \"dw_4184\", \"desc\": \"For each department, show the offer department name, the number of distinct subjects offered by the department in the academic year 2012, and for each subject that was offered in the term \\\"2012SU\\\", display the subject key, subject title, academic year, term description, subject enrollment number, subject offered summary key, the average subject enrollment number within each subject key group, and the deviation of each subject's enrollment number from the average enrollment number for its subject key group, ordered by offer department name and subject key. Do not return any rounded answers.\"}, {\"id\": \"dw_1301\", \"desc\": \"For each academic year, where the maximum number of total units for any Mathematics (Course 18) subject offered in that year is greater than 9 and there are more than 5 Mathematics subjects offered in the fall term, what are the academic year, the maximum total units, the corresponding term description, the subject title, the academic year description, the standard deviation (using STDDEV only and never STDDEV_POP) of the number of enrolled students in library subjects offered during terms in that year, and the average number of equivalent subjects for those library subjects? List the results in order of academic year. Do not return any rounded answers.\"}, {\"id\": \"dw_2151\", \"desc\": \"For each department that grants degrees (excluding the Biology department), provide the department name, the average and variance of the total units for subjects offered by that department in the 2022 academic year, and, if the department is Political Science, also include for each HGN code the maximum number of lecture units among all subjects in the course catalog and the subject title from the subject offered table for subjects offered in the year 2012 wit